<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Frances.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Frances.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co said on Friday it had cut its rating for Argentina's Banco Frances to outperform from a buy.</p>
<p>-- The firm downgraded the company's &quot;because it has hit our price target, which we have boosted moderately to reflect a more aggressive loan growth estimate,&quot; Oppenheimer wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Our new target of $33 represents 13 percent upside.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were off 5/8 to 28-5/8 in New York trade.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
